data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"role": "model","parts": [{"thought": true,"text": "**Defining the Objective**\n\nI'm currently focused on defining the objective: summarizing Level 1 (L1) first-person action briefs into Level 2 (L2) immediate tasks for an egocentric action-prediction dataset. The goal is to distill the L1 information into actionable, L2-level tasks. I'm analyzing the inputs, specifically targeting the desired Level 2 output. This involves grouping the L1 actions into L2 tasks.\n\n\n"}]}}],"modelVersion": "gemini-pro-default","responseId": "dmuiaoSTLpqu39IP7rjdCA","usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount": 2054,"totalTokenCount": 2054}}

